    "name": "CUTISS Newsroom API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Read CUTISS newsroom items (the `newsroom2021` custom post type) from cutiss.swiss as JSON. 28 items published at probe time.\n\nThis is the WordPress REST API that serves cutiss.swiss. CUTISS publishes no product or developer API; this content surface is the only machine-readable API on the company's public host. It is read-only without credentials — every write method and every administrative collection returns HTTP 401 `rest_forbidden`. Derived by API Evangelist from the live route index at https://cutiss.swiss/wp-json/ and live sample responses on 2026-08-11.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: CUTISS AG\n Email: info@cutiss.swiss",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
